# Navigation labels

Every menu, submenu, tab, track chip, and navigation control shows **icon + text**. Never icon-only. Never text-only.

- Prefer Unicode emoji first (no asset file). Keep the English label visible.
- Mark the glyph `aria-hidden="true"`. The text is the accessible name.
- User-made categories: icon of the first required tag, or 📌 if none.
- Custom PNG/SVG live in `public/nav/` (64×64, dark theme, no Pokemon IP).
- If a custom image is required and you cannot generate it, do not ship a blank icon. Give a ready-to-paste prompt: subject, style, colors, size, transparent background, filename.

